(7629270, 1236608, 156466, '<td valign="top">As a "bird photograph" I hate the choice of this B&amp;W treatment as you utterly lose the bird. I like it significantly more as I consider it in the abstract, but even then I find myself wishing you''d done it differently as I believe it could have been amazing. Need to come back to give this one a number.</td>', 'As a "bird photograph" I hate the choice of this B&W treatment as you utterly lose the bird. I like it significantly more as I consider it in the abstract, but even then I find myself wishing you''d done it differently as I believe it could have been amazing. Need to come back to give this one a number.', '2019-05-13 07:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7629271, 1236442, 156466, '<td valign="top">Why, oh why, did you find the need to Topaz (Glow, right? Is it the "Fur &amp; Feathers" or "Cuddly Creatures" preset?) the lovely details of these chicks into oblivion?! Giving you a 6 for the capture and taking away 1 for the processing of what might have otherwise easily been a top 3. There''s ways to use those presets to enhance areas in a shot like this, but the overall effect adds too much noise where there it shouldn''t be and that canvas texture to an otherwise nicely bokeh''d background. I''m not scolding you, I''m speaking as someone who has gone back and reprocessed a dozen photos that I love that once looked very much like this.</td>', 'Why, oh why, did you find the need to Topaz (Glow, right? Is it the "Fur & Feathers" or "Cuddly Creatures" preset?) the lovely details of these chicks into oblivion?! Giving you a 6 for the capture and taking away 1 for the processing of what might have otherwise easily been a top 3. There''s ways to use those presets to enhance areas in a shot like this, but the overall effect adds too much noise where there it shouldn''t be and that canvas texture to an otherwise nicely bokeh''d background. I''m not scolding you, I''m speaking as someone who has gone back and reprocessed a dozen photos that I love that once looked very much like this.', '2019-05-13 07:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
