(7629356, 1236285, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely one of the most beautiful bird photos I''ve ever seen!  There is another one similar to this in this challenge, and I love them both so much!  Both of these images should win Red and Blue ribbons!  I''m not voting in this challenge (because I have an entry in it, and I never vote on challenges I''m competing in), but I love both of these similar images so much, if they don''t win 1st and 2nd, I will be shocked.  Congratulations in advance!</td>', 'This is absolutely one of the most beautiful bird photos I''ve ever seen!  There is another one similar to this in this challenge, and I love them both so much!  Both of these images should win Red and Blue ribbons!  I''m not voting in this challenge (because I have an entry in it, and I never vote on challenges I''m competing in), but I love both of these similar images so much, if they don''t win 1st and 2nd, I will be shocked.  Congratulations in advance!', '2019-05-13 21:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
